WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.840
Eleven mentions.

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.260
But first choice split in two.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.920
In RecoScope’s November 17
protein powder benchmark,

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.000
Optimum Nutrition appeared in
11 of 12 usable answers.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.480
Transparent Labs and Dymatize
each appeared in seven.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.240
In the comparative prompt,

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.700
ChatGPT and Claude ranked
Transparent Labs first.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.180
Gemini and Perplexity ranked
Optimum Nutrition first.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.300
Same strength-training
and desk-job profile.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.100
Four AI assistants.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.440
Three prompt types: discovery,
under $50, and ranking.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:37.200
Optimum Nutrition, Dymatize and Orgain
appeared in every budget answer.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.220
But brand mentions don’t verify
an under-$50 checkout price,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.980
and the exact formulas varied.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:46.140
Visibility and comparative rank
are separate measures.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.120
These findings describe captured
answers, not product quality.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.100
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
